sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Restaurant Staff
    participant API as Dashboard API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant CE as Engine notifier
    participant WA as Meta Cloud API
    S->>API: PATCH /orders/{id}/status · Bearer token · x-restaurant-id<br/>{ from, to, reason? }
    API->>DB: app.verify_membership(staff_id, restaurant_id)
    DB-->>API: active membership?
    alt no membership
        API-->>S: 403 (identical to "no such restaurant")
    else membership confirmed
        API->>API: canStaffTransition(from, to) — else 409 transition_not_allowed
        API->>DB: BEGIN · set_config('app.current_restaurant_id', rid, true)
        API->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status=to, notified=false (+ ready_at · collected · cancellation)<br/>WHERE id=? AND status=from [AND cash OR paid]
        DB-->>API: rowcount
        alt rowcount = 0
            API->>DB: re-read the order
            API-->>S: 404, or 409 status_conflict with the current status, or 409 payment_not_settled
        else rowcount = 1
            API->>DB: INSERT order_status_history (actor='staff', actor_staff_id, reason)
            API->>DB: COMMIT
            API-->>S: 200 with the updated order
        end
    end
    loop every 5 seconds
        CE->>DB: app.restaurants_with_unnotified_orders() · then per restaurant:<br/>UPDATE orders SET notified=true WHERE id=? AND notified=false
        opt accepted, ready or cancelled — and within 23 h 50 min of the order
            CE->>WA: status text (two retries, then logged)
        end
    end
    Note over S,WA: Not built: the 24-hour pickup expiry and the 2-hour payment timeout (no scheduler yet),<br/>refunds (online payment deferred) and customer statistics on completed (FR-14).
